    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93449" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαύρ-α</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαύρη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lizard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				146
			</span></i> codd. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.192
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				183
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				488a24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				489b21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.58
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαῦρος</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαλαμάνδρα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρδαμον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				74.72
			</span></i>:— also as 
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαυρίδιον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ulc.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.136
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>membrum virile</i>, esp. of boys, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.3
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				242
			</span></i> (Id.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ς. αἱ ἐκ φοινίκων
			πεπλεγμέναι</span> plaited <i>cases</i> of palm-bark, used in
			setting dislocated fingers, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				80
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				188
			</span></i>.</div>
